.SH NAME
jitterentropy, jent_entropy_init, jent_entropy_init_ex, jent_selftest, jent_entropy_collector_alloc, jent_entropy_collector_free, jent_read_entropy, jent_read_entropy_safe, jent_status, jent_uuid, jent_secure_memory_supported, jent_version, jent_set_fips_failure_callback, jent_entropy_switch_notime_impl, jent_entropy_set_notime_cpu, jent_notime_init, jent_notime_fini \- CPU Jitter Random Number Generator
.SH LIBRARY
Jitter RNG library
.RI ( libjitterentropy ", " \-ljitterentropy ).
.BR pkg\-config (1)
knows it as
.IR jitterentropy ,
and where the library was installed by its CMake build, CMake's
.B find_package(jitterentropy)
provides the imported target
.IR jitterentropy::jitterentropy .
